
Speaker: Raphael Köllner

Title: Copilot Control System - Agent Management

Description: 
Manage the use of generative AI in your organization with the Copilot Control System in Microsoft 365. Determine who can find, use, and create agents, define permissions, approve or block agent deployment, and configure billing models, including pay-as-you-go or prepaid options.

Get a detailed overview of agent usage, the users and groups driving consumption, and the associated costs. With Microsoft Purview integration, you can monitor the disclosure of sensitive data, track compliance risks, and review agent activity to ensure your organization's data security and compliance.
